---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DisplayTitle from '../components/DisplayTitle.astro';
---

<Layout title="Guiding Principles for European Integration" description="The principles guiding this vision for European reform: subsidiarity, transparency, and reform that keeps the EU accountable to its citizens.">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8">
    <DisplayTitle title="Guiding Principles" />
    
    <div class="mb-10 text-xl" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
      Our framework for European integration is built on core principles that ensure reforms benefit all member states while making Europe stronger and more competitive globally.
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
      <!-- Principle 1 -->
      <div class="principle p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gradient-to-br rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3" 
               style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--color-accent-primary), var(--color-accent-secondary));">
            <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Seeking Mutual Benefit</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Focus on reforms that provide clear advantages to all member states, fostering a spirit of collective progress rather than zero-sum competition.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Principle 2 -->
      <div class="principle p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gradient-to-br rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3" 
               style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--color-accent-primary), var(--color-accent-secondary));">
            <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Leveraging Economies of Scale</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Develop solutions collectively that would be too expensive or complex for individual nations to create independently.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Principle 3 -->
      <div class="principle p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gradient-to-br rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3" 
               style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--color-accent-primary), var(--color-accent-secondary));">
            <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Building a Common Culture</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Foster a European identity alongside national cultures through shared systems, language, and infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Principle 4 -->
      <div class="principle p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gradient-to-br rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3" 
               style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--color-accent-primary), var(--color-accent-secondary));">
            <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Improving Quality of Life</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Address challenges too big for individual nations through radical reforms and shifting appropriate competencies to the EU level.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Extended Principles Section -->
    <DisplayTitle level={2} title="Applying Our Principles" class="mt-12 mb-6" />
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Economic Integration</h3>
        <p class="mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Our approach to economic integration focuses on reducing transaction costs and administrative barriers, enabling businesses of all sizes to operate seamlessly across the European market.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          By implementing unified digital payment systems, standardized administrative procedures, and blockchain-based contracts, we can eliminate millions of hours wasted on redundant paperwork and create true economic efficiency.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Cultural Approach</h3>
        <p class="mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Rather than forcing artificial cultural integration, our vision relies on building shared infrastructure and systems that naturally bring Europeans together through daily interactions and collaboration.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Language integration serves as the foundation, enabling Europeans to communicate directly while preserving linguistic diversity and national cultural identities.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Technological Leadership</h3>
        <p class="mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          European integration must position the continent as a technological leader, particularly in fields where we have existing strengths: industrial automation, precision engineering, and sustainable technologies.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          By establishing unified robotics standards, shared research initiatives, and continent-wide manufacturing policies, we can create a new European industrial renaissance.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Pragmatic Implementation</h3>
        <p class="mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Our vision embraces a pragmatic approach to implementation, starting with willing member states and expanding as benefits become apparent to others.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          This allows for faster experimentation, adaptation based on real-world feedback, and avoids the paralysis that can occur when trying to achieve unanimous agreement among all member states simultaneously.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comprehensive Principles Section -->
    <div class="relative mt-16 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-colors duration-300" 
         style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 left-0 h-2 rounded-t-xl" 
           style="background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-accent-primary), var(--color-accent-secondary));"></div>
      
      <DisplayTitle level={2} title="Vision for European Cooperation and Integration" class="mb-8" />
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none transition-colors duration-300" 
           style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
        
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Principles of Mutual Benefit</h3>
        <p>
          The proposed reforms are designed with a fundamental principle: creating value for all member states through strategic cooperation. This vision isn't about compromise - it's about identifying and developing areas where cooperation naturally generates greater value than individual action.
        </p>
        
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Nothing unites people more than common business.</h3>
        <p>
          The proposed reforms aren't just about integration - they're about reaching for extraordinary opportunities that emerge when we work together. This vision is futuristic and pragmatic at the same time: it identifies futuristic areas where cooperation can generate significant economic growth and quality of life improvements for all Europeans. By working together, we can achieve things that would be impossible to reach separately. This proposal outlines specific areas of cooperation and ways to organize them to maximize our collective potential.
        </p>
        
        <h3 style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Why this urgency</h3>
        <p>
          The demographic case for acting now — the shared condition, the window of roughly thirty
          years we still have to build the systems that will carry us, and the shift from relying on
          more workers to relying on automation — is laid out in full in
          <a href="/book/designing-our-retirement" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary); text-decoration: underline;">Designing Our Retirement</a>.
          What follows here is not that argument again; it is the rules we apply once we accept it.
        </p>

        <h3 style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Who captures the gains</h3>
        <p>
          Every proposal on this site has to answer who benefits from automating what an aging
          society can no longer staff — private capital, or everyone. Settling ownership first is
          the wrong order. What matters more is that the technology stays cheap enough that
          ownership cannot be enclosed:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Cheap to buy and run</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Available to every municipality, farm and clinic</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Built on open standards</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Hard to monopolise</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">A Win-Win Cooperation Model</h3>
        <p>
          The success of this vision depends on member states' willingness to embrace empathetic cooperation over egocentric competition. While concerns and fears are natural, the proposed framework deliberately focuses on areas where integration benefits all participants. The goal is to create a cooperation model where:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Every member state gains more than they invest.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Collective efficiency increases through integration.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Shared solutions address common challenges.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-1" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">✓</span>
            <span>Innovation and progress benefit all participants.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        
        <p class="mt-8">
          We have roughly thirty years of working economy left to build the systems that will carry
          us through the decades after — not as a burden managed in decline, but as a testament to
          the power of innovation and cooperation applied in time. The ultimate goal is to design
          systems that allow Europeans to live dignified, enjoyable lives, supported by the fruits of
          their collective work and technological advancements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Call to Action Section -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="/vision" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors duration-300" 
         style="background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-accent-primary), var(--color-accent-secondary)); color: white;">
        Explore the Full Vision
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>